cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the article in preferred-citation when you use the software."
type: software
title: "qnca: Quantile Necessary Condition Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Implementations in R (qnca), Python (qnca) and Julia (QuantileNecessity) of
  Quantile Necessary Condition Analysis, which extends Necessary Condition
  Analysis with a tolerance: for each outcome target, the frontier is a low
  type-1 quantile of the condition among the cases that attain the target.
